				<div class="newsinfo">
						
					<h3>John A. Logan College Foundation Encourages Community to Support Promise Scholarship on Giving Tuesday, Dec. 1</h3>
					<p>John A. Logan College is encouraging alumni, employees, businesses, and community members to support the John A. Logan College Promise Scholarship during the annual Day of Giving on Tuesday, Dec. 1.</p>
					<p><a href="https://www.jalc.edu/2026/11/17/john-a-logan-college-foundation-encourages-community-to-support-promise-scholarship-on-giving-tuesday-dec-1/" class="btn">Read the Full Story</a></p>
					<p class="mt-4"><a href="/news-archives/">View Our News Archives</a></p>

