					<p class="sbi_hover_caption_wrap"
		>
		<span
			class="sbi_caption">Earn a paycheck while preparing for your career? Yes, please. 🙌<br><br>JALC surgical technology student Liliana Smith is getting paid for her clinical hours through an apprenticeship with Southern Illinois Healthcare. She’s gaining hands-on experience, building confidence and putting her classroom skills to work.<br><br>Curious about earning while you learn? Head to jalc.edu and click the News tab to read Liliana’s story and find out who to contact about apprenticeship opportunities! 💙<br><br>#JALC @sih_healthcare #EarnWhileYouLearn #Apprenticeships #SurgicalTechnology</span>
	</p>

			</div>

			
			<div class="sbi_hover_bottom " >

				
									<div
						class="sbi_meta" >

							<span
		class="sbi_likes" style="font-size: 13px;" >
