			<a class="sbi_link_area nofancybox" rel="nofollow noopener" href="https://scontent.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.82787-15/911425025_18605271100066968_1233583174765139059_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e35_tt6&#038;_nc_cat=100&#038;ccb=7-5&#038;_nc_sid=18de74&#038;efg=eyJlZmdfdGFnIjoiRkVFRC5iZXN0X2ltYWdlX3VybGdlbi5DMyJ9&#038;_nc_ohc=yMaIlXy18gIQ7kNvwGrqFmK&#038;_nc_oc=AdpaDfkkHaZgz35gi5aSFCen83Qy8kUY03wEN44-Pne_NpoQG_G6x8U04dCUvbglvIw&#038;_nc_zt=23&#038;_nc_ht=scontent.cdninstagram.com&#038;edm=AFF3FJ0EAAAA&#038;_nc_gid=PRe6aTFWHM67GxR2aGJXhQ&#038;_nc_ct=RQosPBUKFQIAAAA&#038;oh=00_AQQ_gQGGTd2CTq6IGBwV554QpQMMhN-3ZCVXa8Xz9NjAXw&#038;oe=6B026C57"
			   data-lightbox-sbi=""
			   data-title="Earn a paycheck while preparing for your career? Yes, please. 🙌&lt;br&gt;
&lt;br&gt;
JALC surgical technology student Liliana Smith is getting paid for her clinical hours through an apprenticeship with Southern Illinois Healthcare. She’s gaining hands-on experience, building confidence and putting her classroom skills to work.&lt;br&gt;
