					<p class="sbi_hover_caption_wrap"
		>
		<span
			class="sbi_caption">Let’s give together, Vols! 💙<br><br>A little from each of us can mean a lot to someone else.<br><br>The Student Senate Thanksgiving Food Drive supports JALC students in need and is part of ICCB’s Feed the Need competition among Illinois community colleges.<br><br>Drop off non-perishable food by November 17 in donation boxes near main entrances and in campus lounges.<br><br>#JALC #FeedtheNeed #Thanksgiving #FoodDrive</span>
	</p>

