									<p class="sbi_caption_wrap" >
						<span
							class="sbi_caption"  style="font-size: 12px;color: rgb(67,73,96);" aria-hidden="true">Ever have so much to do that you don’t know where to start? When deadlines pile up, even getting started can feel overwhelming. Recognizing that feeling is a good time to check in with yourself and reach out for support. You don’t have to wait until you’re at your breaking point. 💙 jalc.edu/student-success-center<br><br>#JALC #MentalHealthMatters #JALCStudentSupport</span>
