					<h4 class="mt-4">CAMPUS SAFETY NOTICE</h4>
					<p class="mb-0">John A. Logan College hosts programs that serve minors, including Mary Logan High School and SIU Head Start.</p>
					<p>Consistent with applicable law and College policy, registered sex offenders are prohibited from entering or remaining on the John A. Logan College campus or within 500 feet of the campus.</p>

